      "sourceTextSha256": "9cd4f62cd80ff511bf1fdb40f628d2fbb9c8c27280e9051fe2b202bb0f581526",
      "text": "Day 10 · A boat tour on the Río Frío, from Los Chiles near the Nicaraguan border, in the Caño Negro Wildlife Refuge, a Ramsar wetland and one of the most diverse habitats in Costa Rica: anhingas, herons and cormorants, howler, spider and white-faced monkeys, three-toed sloths, caimans, basilisk (“Jesus Christ”) lizards and turtles. Lunch, then return to Arenal. Overnight at Arenal Paraíso Resort & Spa. (B, L)",
